    {
      "id": "text-11",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "Climate March Zuidas",
        "body": "Greenpeace opened Climate March Zuidas, Amsterdam with a demonstration of MoneyTrees. The demonstration featured a large prop tree being attacked by volunteers dressed as bankers as the 'MoneyTrees' song played.\n\n‍\n\nOver 15,000 people joined the climate march that happened a week ahead of the European Elections, demanding that banks such as Rabobank, ING and ABN Amro change their course and stop investing their money in deforestation, mining or pollution."
      },
      "padBottom": "4-5"
    },
