    {
      "id": "quote-18",
      "type": "quote",
      "content": {
        "quote": "\"I am thrilled to present 'MoneyTrees,' a song that explores the theme of human greed through the lens of caricatured corporate bankers. The music mirrors the intensity of Greenpeace's message through chaotic beats and primal cries that mirror the sounds of revving chainsaws, accompanied by a bassline that strikes like an axe.”",
        "cite": "Music Artist GreedyBoy alias Joe Wills"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-19",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "Campaign Identity",
        "body": "We created a campaign identity to unify all of the assets under the same look. Central to the identity was the logo which had to communicate the feeling of the campaign as well as all of the themes surrounding it."
      },
